    "description": "Single-Spark NVFP4 candidate with 262,144 combined context tokens and up to four requests sharing a fixed 4 GiB cache. Images are resized to about one megapixel, with up to four images per request. Uses pinned MiaAI-Lab patches and a reusable 27 GiB CPU offload table with a 512 MiB resident-page budget and clean weight-page reclamation before GPU profiling, followed by scratch-cache reclamation before context-cache allocation; speculative decoding, prefix caching, FlashInfer autotuning and CUDA graphs are disabled. First launch prepares the engine and table, then model startup can take about 11 minutes. Security and packaged-lifecycle release gates remain open.",
